        <p class="lead">${o('File pecah, latar belum bersih, atau tepi berbayang baru ketahuan setelah film tercetak. <b>Cek Gambar</b> memeriksanya dalam hitungan detik, <span class="badge-free">GRATIS</span>','Low resolution, a dirty background or haloed edges usually show up only after the film is printed. The <b>Image Checker</b> catches them in seconds, <span class="badge-free">FREE</span>')}</p>
